---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Who we are" description="The Vernacular Labs team brings together statistical methodology, political data science, and years of campaign analytics experience.">

  <section class="container-site pt-14 md:pt-20 pb-10">
    <p class="eyebrow mb-4">Our Team</p>
    <h1 class="font-heading text-h1 max-w-4xl">
      Researchers and practitioners &mdash; who have been <em>doing</em> this work.
    </h1>
  </section>

  <section class="container-site pb-10">
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-12 gap-10 md:gap-14 items-start">
      <div class="md:col-span-7">
        <p class="prose-body mb-6">
          Vernacular Labs was founded by researchers and practitioners with deep roots in
          political data science, statistical methodology, and Democratic campaign analytics.
        </p>
        <p class="prose-body mb-6">
          Our team&rsquo;s work has been published in leading academic journals and has shaped data
          strategy for campaigns and organizations across the country.
        </p>
        <p class="prose-body italic text-ash">
          Full team bios coming soon.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="md:col-span-5">
        <img
          src="/images/who-we-are-overhead.jpg"
          alt="Overhead view of two researchers collaborating at a shared desk"
          class="w-full rounded-card shadow-photo"
          loading="lazy"
        />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="container-site mt-20">
    <div class="border-t border-line pt-10 flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center md:justify-between gap-4">
      <p class="font-heading text-callout text-ink">Want to know more?</p>
      <a href="/contact" class="btn-primary">Get in touch</a>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>
